## What Is {{SITE_NAME}}?

{{SITE_NAME}} (abbreviated {{SITE_SHORT_NAME}}) is a consultancy that serves founders and managing partners who are too busy to handle everything themselves. Founded on April 1, 2005 by Cécile Noiriel, registered under SIREN 481 631 471, {{SITE_NAME}} has spent over 20 years proving that founders don't lack ideas — they lack time and structure to execute them. A second entity (SIREN 814 783 056) was created in November 2015 by Anne Grosz, specializing in externalized general secretariat for law firms and SMEs. As of {{BUILD_YEAR}}, the team is four: Cécile Noiriel, Anne Grosz, Georges Grosz, and Romain Cornu.

## Services

1. **Operational Backbone** — {{SITE_NAME}} externalizes your entire back-office — general secretariat, admin, finance, and compliance — so founders stop drowning in operational detail and start leading. Run by a team with 20+ years of law firm and SME operational experience.
2. **Transformation & Data** — {{SITE_NAME}} rebuilds the systems layer: architecture, project governance, and data strategy that turn operational chaos into measurable clarity. Anchored in 22+ years of CGI systems consulting and academic expertise at Université Paris 1 Panthéon-Sorbonne.
3. **Growth Engine** — {{SITE_NAME}} engineers the full commercial pipeline — ICP, outbound, acquisition funnels, revenue metrics — so B2B revenue growth becomes systematic, not accidental. Built on proven playbooks from MerciApp, Clovis, and Datananas.
4. **Legal Practice Ops** — Purpose-built operational support for law firms where precision is non-negotiable. Born from Anne Grosz's 8 years as Secretary General at Vatier & Associés — admin, finance, compliance, and client file management handled with law-firm precision.

